Package: cudaverse
Title: GPU-Aware Numerical Computing for R
Version: 0.2.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Yaoxiang", "Li", email = "liyaoxiang@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides one coherent interface for experimental GPU-aware
    numerical computing in R. Includes dense tensors, sparse matrices,
    decompositions, distances, nearest neighbours, clustering, graph
    workflows, and embeddings. Uses optional CUDA backend extensions for GPU
    execution and portable R backends for development, testing, and
    reproducible fallback behavior.
